{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_24","type":"agent_message","text":"The first browser run initialized Three.js on WebGPU and loaded the game without JavaScript errors. Headless WebGPU screenshots showed the blank-canvas issue noted in your environment, so I’m checking composition through the WebGL fallback and using state checks for WebGPU. I also fixed a duplicate Enter activation in menus."}}
