{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_38","type":"agent_message","text":"The campaign playthrough completed all four heats and reached the finale. I also found a Hub startup problem: shader warm-up could delay readiness while the Hub card covered the game. The game now reports ready without waiting for that warm-up, and dedicated-server copies run the simulation without creating a renderer."}}
